# Intentionally tracked: server/src/xbot2_gui_server/monitor/
# It is the production web bundle shipped in the Python package, allowing the
# robot to serve the monitor without Node.js installed.
# Vite copies this proto maintenance helper with the schemas, but the browser
# neither uses nor needs it.
server/src/xbot2_gui_server/monitor/update_proto.bash
